"name":{"zh":"五丈原","en":"Wuzhang Plains"},"year":"234","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,38,69,74,57,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10515","name":{"zh":"高平陵之变","en":"Incident at Gaoping Tombs"},"year":"249","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,38,69,74,57,52],"title":-1,"rank":"9","loyalty":"0","reputation":"0","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S11315","name":{"zh":"西陵之战","en":"Battle of Xiling"},"year":"272","month":"1"},"faction":null,"city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"3","role":0,"stats":[60,38,69,74,57,52],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]},{"story":{"id":"S10108","name":{"zh":"英雄集结","en":"A Gathering of Heroes"},"year":"300","month":"3"},"faction":"WJ10045","city":"CS1040","noRecruit":false,"reject":null,"state":"2","role":0,"stats":[60,38,69,74,57,52],"title":-1,"rank":"6","loyalty":"98","reputation":"16600","equipment":{"weapon":"WP10014","armor":"WP1003105","helmet":"WP1026405"},"couple":[]}],"storyEvents":[],"biography":{"zh":"益州重要官员，初为议郎，后投靠刘焉、刘璋父子，官至巴西太守。抵御从汉中南下的张鲁势力，成为东州士族领袖。其招募的賨人部曲战斗力强悍，曾助刘璋平定赵韪叛乱。后拥兵自重，暗怀异志。后察觉张鲁南下，急报于刘璋，与刘璋一同引刘备入蜀并投降于刘备。刘备定蜀后封其为左将军司马。","tc":"益州重要官員，初為議郎，后投靠劉焉、劉璋父子，官至巴西太守。抵御從漢中南下的張魯勢力，成為東州士族領袖。其招募的賨人部曲戰斗力強悍，曾助劉璋平定趙韙叛亂。后擁兵自重，暗懷異志。后察覺張魯南下，急報于劉璋，與劉璋一同引劉備入蜀并投降于劉備。劉備定蜀后封其為左將軍司馬。","en":"A key official of Yi Province. Initially serving as a Consultant, he later joined Liu Yan and his son Liu Zhang, rising to Governor of Baxi. He repelled the faction of Zhang Lu advancing south from Hanzhong, becoming a leader among the Dongzhou gentry. The Cong troops he recruited were formidable fighters who helped Liu Zhang suppress Zhao Wei's rebellion. Later, commanding substantial forces, he secretly harbored ambitions of his own. Upon learning that Zhang Lu was pushing south, he urgently reported to Liu Zhang, joined him in inviting Liu Bei into Shu, and eventually chose to surrender to Liu Bei. After Liu Bei pacified Shu, he appointed him Jnr Minister of War under the East Commander.","jp":"益州の重臣。初めは議郎を務め、後に劉焉・劉璋父子を頼り、官位は巴西太守に至った。漢中から南下を図る張魯の勢力を防ぎ、東州士族の領袖となった。募った賨人の部曲は精強を誇り、かつて劉璋による趙韙の叛乱鎮圧を助けた。後に兵を擁して自重し、密かに異心を抱いた。その後、張魯の南下を察知して劉璋に急報し、劉璋と共に劉備を蜀へ招き入れて劉備に降伏した。劉備が蜀を平定した後は左将軍司馬に任じられた。","kr":"익주의 주요 관리로, 처음에는 의랑을 지냈으나 이후 유언·유장 부자에게 의탁하여 관직이 파서태수에 이르렀다. 한중에서 남하하는 장로 세력을 막아내며 동주 사족의 영수가 되었다. 그가 모집한 총인 부곡은 전투력이 막강하여, 유장을 도와 조위의 반란을 평정하기도 했다. 이후에는 군세를 믿고 자중하며 은밀히 딴마음을 품었다. 훗날 장로의 남하를 알아채고 유장에게 급보를 전했으며, 유장과 함께 유비를 촉으로 불러들인 뒤 유비에게 항복했다. 유비가 촉을 평정한 뒤 그를 좌장군사마로 임명했다."},"notRecommended":{"type":"0","year":"999","reason":{"zh":"","tc":"","en":"","jp":"","kr":""}},"raw":{"userIndex":"15","id":"WJ10265","remark":"","surname":"庞","surnameTc":"龐","surnameEn":"Pang","surnameJp":"龐","surnameKr":"방","surnameOther":"","name":"羲","nameTc":"羲","nameEn":"Xi","nameJp":"羲","nameKr":"희","nameOther":"","word":"","wordTc":"","wordEn":"","wordJp":"","wordKr":"","wordOther":"","icon":"庞羲","power":"WJ10045","rejectPower":"","rejectDuration":"0","ignoreUnRecruit":"0","ignoreUnSelectable":"0","unSelectable":"0","recruit":"1","travel":"0","state":"2","workYear":"184","city":"CS1040","gender":"0","rule":"60","force":"38","wise":"69","politics":"74","charm":"57","will":"52","ruleTalent":"6","forceTalent":"3","wiseTalent":"7","politicsTalent":"8","charmTalent":"5","willTalent":"4","weaponMaster":"12/12/51/12/12/49/50/12","battleAttribute":"1/1/1/1/1/1/1/1","debateAttribute":"1/1/1","warSkill":"","battleSkill":"","debateCard":"","warSoul":"","battleSoul":"","debateSoul":"","warSoulPoint":"3600","battleSoulPoint":"1400","debateSoulPoint":"4700","strategy":"","strategy2":"1001405","pr